  "brief": {
    "situation": "You are setting up the PMO at Wexford Logistics, a fictional logistics company. Project managers see the PMO as 'the reporting police'; executives want portfolio visibility.",
    "handover": [
      "The PMO today: a status template and a monthly chase for reports.",
      "Three customer groups: executives, project managers, functional managers."
    ],
    "howItWorks": [
      "The board shows the risk register against the appetite, each stakeholder's support in words and the docket.",
      "Move on a week at a time. A decision comes to you at each review; before the first, you can read the evidence.",
      "At the end you write the record and a short reflection."
    ]
  },
